      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "전에 허리를 삐끗했을 때는\n포켓몬의 기술로 고칠 수 있었어요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C804C5D00020D5C8B9ACB97C0020C090B057D588C7440020B54CB294000AD3ECCF13BAACC7580020AE30C220B85C0020ACE0CE600020C2180020C788C5C8C5B4C694002E00100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기술의 이름은 분명...\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>문어굳히기<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>였던 것 같아요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30C220C7580020C774B984C7400020BD84BA85002E002E002E000A00100002FF000006BB38C5B4AD73D788AE3000100002FF000000C600B3580020AC830020AC19C544C694002E00100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "죄송하지만\n제게 문어굳히기를 사용해 주시겠어요?<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>케오퍼스<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>라는 포켓몬이 배울 수 있을 거예요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C8C4C1A1D558C9C0B9CC000AC81CAC8C0020BB38C5B4AD73D788AE30B97C0020C0ACC6A9D5740020C8FCC2DCACA0C5B4C694003F00100001BE00000A00100002FF000006CF00C624D37CC2A400100002FF000000B77CB2940020D3ECCF13BAACC7740020BC30C6B80020C2180020C788C7440020AC70C608C694002E00100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "당신이...\n제 유일한 희망이에요...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
